sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Sender
    actor R as Recipient
    actor A as Admin
    participant API as FastAPI + SQLite
    participant FX as Exchange-rate API
    participant Q as Redis Streams
    participant W as Settlement worker
    participant X as XRPL Testnet

    rect rgb(238, 243, 248)
    Note over S,X: 1. Register and log in
    S->>API: POST /auth/register
    S->>API: POST /auth/login
    API-->>S: Bearer token (stored only as a SHA-256 hash)
    end

    rect rgb(248, 245, 236)
    Note over S,X: 2. Mock KYC
    S->>API: POST /kyc (ID number Fernet-encrypted)
    A->>API: POST /kyc/{id}/approve or /reject
    Note over S,API: Unapproved senders cannot create quotes
    end

    rect rgb(238, 243, 248)
    Note over S,X: 3. Add a beneficiary
    S->>API: POST /beneficiaries
    API-->>S: Linked if mobile or email matches a user, else linked when the recipient registers
    end

    rect rgb(248, 245, 236)
    Note over S,X: 4. Quote
    S->>API: POST /remittances (ZAR amount)
    API->>FX: GET USD/ZAR (cached 5 min, .env fallback)
    FX-->>API: Mid-market rate
    API->>API: Apply fee model, check daily and monthly limits
    API-->>S: Quote: fee breakdown, UCTUSD amount, tracking_ref MG + 10 digits, expires_at (15 min)
    end

    rect rgb(238, 243, 248)
    Note over S,X: 5. Cancel or let expire
    opt Sender cancels before expiry
        S->>API: POST /remittances/{id}/cancel
        API-->>S: cancelled
    end
    Note over S,API: Cancelled and expired quotes do not count toward limits
    end

    rect rgb(248, 245, 236)
    Note over S,X: 6. Cash-in (simulated)
    S->>API: POST /remittances/{id}/cash-in (agent cash, bank transfer or card)
    API-->>S: cash_in_pending
    A->>API: POST /remittances/{id}/confirm-cash-in
    API->>API: cash_in_confirmed, insert settlement message (outbox)
    API->>Q: XADD settlement_messages
    API-->>A: settlement_queued
    Note over S,Q: Settlement is never queued before admin confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(238, 243, 248)
    Note over S,X: 7. XRPL settlement
    W->>Q: XREADGROUP (own pending, then idle, then new entries)
    Q-->>W: Settlement message
    opt First settlement for this recipient
        W->>X: Create custodial account, TrustSet to UCTUSD issuer
    end
    W->>X: Payment, treasury to recipient (memo = remittance id)
    alt Payment validated
        X-->>W: tesSUCCESS + transaction hash
        W->>API: One commit: store hash, credit spendable balance, status settled
    else Payment fails
        X-->>W: Error code (e.g. tecPATH_DRY)
        W->>API: status settlement_failed, no credit
    end
    W->>Q: XACK (only after completed or failed)
    end

    rect rgb(248, 245, 236)
    Note over S,X: 8. Recipient wallet
    R->>API: GET /wallet/me
    API-->>R: Spendable and on-chain UCTUSD, incoming transfers with hashes, cash-out history
    end

    rect rgb(238, 243, 248)
    Note over S,X: 9. Cash-out (fiat payout simulated)
    R->>API: POST /cash-outs (USD or ZAR, approved KYC required)
    API-->>R: requested, spendable balance debited (reserved)
    alt Approve, then complete
        A->>API: POST /cash-outs/{id}/approve
        A->>API: POST /cash-outs/{id}/complete
        API->>X: Payment, recipient account to UCTUSD issuer (burn)
        X-->>API: Transaction hash
        Note over R,X: on_chain_balance now excludes this cash-out
    else Fail (from requested or approved)
        A->>API: POST /cash-outs/{id}/fail
        API-->>R: Spendable balance refunded
    end
    end

    rect rgb(248, 245, 236)
    Note over S,X: Tracking (any time)
    S->>API: GET /remittances/track/{ref}
    Note over S,API: Allowed for the sender, the linked recipient or an admin (UI: /app/track/{ref})
    end
